  "categorias": "Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p>El Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda ha acogido esta tarde el primer &#39;networking&#39;, organizado por el Club Networking Castell&oacute;n, con la colaboraci&oacute;n del Ayuntamiento,&nbsp;en el que representantes de una veintena de empresas se han podido poner en contacto y establecer sinergias.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/04/IMG_4854.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Han introducido el acto el teniente de alcalde de Desarrollo Econ&oacute;mico, Ram&oacute;n Sebasti&aacute;n, y el presidente del Club Networking de Castell&oacute;n, Juan Adsuara. Despu&eacute;s, Ernest Fenollosa ha presentado una ponencia sobre network marketing, el trabajo del siglo XXI seg&uacute;n sus palabras.</p>\n<p>Tras un peque&ntilde;o descanso, ha sido el turno de las entrevistas e intercambio directo de una empresa con otra y as&iacute; sucesivamente, para explicarse sus experiencias y poder establecer lazos de colaboraci&oacute;n. Hab&iacute;a representantes de empresas, tanto de Onda, como de Castell&oacute;n, Vila-real o la Vall d&#39;Uix&oacute;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4832.jpg\" alt=\"img_4832\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4834.jpg\" alt=\"img_4834\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4835.jpg\" alt=\"img_4835\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4836.jpg\" alt=\"img_4836\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4837.jpg\" alt=\"img_4837\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4838.jpg\" alt=\"img_4838\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4839.jpg\" alt=\"img_4839\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4840.jpg\" alt=\"img_4840\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4841.jpg\" alt=\"img_4841\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4842.jpg\" alt=\"img_4842\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4843.jpg\" alt=\"img_4843\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4844.jpg\" alt=\"img_4844\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4845.jpg\" alt=\"img_4845\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4846.jpg\" alt=\"img_4846\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4847.jpg\" alt=\"img_4847\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4848.jpg\" alt=\"img_4848\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4849.jpg\" alt=\"img_4849\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda/img_4850.jpg\" alt=\"img_4850\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/